---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Research Membership | USD Impact"
  description="USD Impact Research Membership includes current Weekly Reports, monthly research, complete Weekly Score history, and private invite-only TradingView access."
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="hero reports-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">USD Impact Research Membership</p>
        <h1>Go deeper than the daily update.</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Current Weekly Reports, ongoing monthly research, the complete Weekly Score dashboard and history,
          and private invite-only TradingView indicator access in one recurring research membership.
        </p>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button primary" href="/research/sample/">Read the complete public sample</a>
          <a class="button" href="/research/account/">Research account</a>
        </div>
        <p class="edition-meta">Research Membership checkout is not yet open. Launch remains subject to the final operational gates.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container account-shell">
      <section class="card account-panel" aria-labelledby="pricing-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">One membership, two billing choices</p>
        <h2 id="pricing-heading">Same research access on monthly or annual billing</h2>
        <div class="account-format-grid">
          <article class="account-format-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">Best Value — save USD 58</p>
            <h3>USD 290/year</h3>
            <p>Annual billing receives the same Research Membership entitlement and protected features as monthly billing.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="account-format-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">Monthly alternative</p>
            <h3>USD 29/month</h3>
            <p>Month-to-month billing with the same included research. No free trial and no introductory discount.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <p class="account-help">Applicable taxes may be added by the merchant of record.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="card account-panel" aria-labelledby="included-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Included at launch</p>
        <h2 id="included-heading">The Research Membership scope</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Full current Weekly Reports and the member archive.</li>
          <li>Ongoing monthly research reports.</li>
          <li>Complete Weekly Score dashboard, history, and detailed breakdowns.</li>
          <li>Private invite-only TradingView indicator access with hidden source.</li>
          <li>Maintained indicator updates and educational alerts.</li>
          <li>Recurring member research delivery.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Daily USD Impact remains public. The Guided Interactive Edition, audiobook, Video Library, saved learning
          progress, and other Library Pass resources remain a separate permanent product and do not depend on a
          Research Membership subscription.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="card account-panel" aria-labelledby="sample-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Evaluate before subscribing</p>
        <h2 id="sample-heading">A complete Weekly Report, not a teaser</h2>
        <p>
          The public sample is the complete Weekly USD Impact Brief for the week ending August 7, 2026. It is kept
          at least 30 days behind current member research and contains no private TradingView source, private invite
          link, live member-only alert, current detailed score history, or private download.
        </p>
        <a class="button primary" href="/research/sample/">Open the public sample</a>
      </section>

      <section class="card account-panel" aria-labelledby="billing-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Billing and cancellation</p>
        <h2 id="billing-heading">Cancel anytime; keep access through the paid period</h2>
        <p>
          Cancellation prevents the next renewal and takes effect at the end of the current paid billing period.
          Refund handling follows the merchant of record's current policy plus mandatory consumer law; USD Impact
          does not add a separate blanket refund guarantee at launch.
        </p>
        <p>
          Canceling, refunding, suspending, or ending Research Membership never removes permanent access obtained
          through a separate Library Pass purchase.
        </p>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button" href="/research/account/">Review Research account</a>
          <a class="button" href="/terms/">Terms</a>
          <a class="button" href="/refund-policy/">Refund policy</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="compliance" aria-label="Compliance note">
        <strong>Compliance note:</strong> USD Impact Research Membership is educational and informational only. It is not investment,
        financial, trading, legal, or tax advice and is not a recommendation to buy or sell any asset.
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
